Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer’s design brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Nalia Vero\nSeller: Kito Nemu, independent mobile UI designer, Kenya\nProject: LumaNest mobile app\n\nPlease design a clickable five-screen mobile app UI prototype for our home-organizing app. The screens should cover sign-in, the home dashboard, room list, task details, and settings. Use a calm palette and provide the editable design file along with a link to the prototype.\n\nAgreed project fee: EUR 480. Delivery is planned for 18 September 2025. One round of minor visual revisions is included. This brief covers interface design only; development and app-store submission are not included."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer–seller chat",
      "text": "14 September 2025\n09:12 Nalia: Thanks for taking on the LumaNest screens. The five-screen prototype in the brief is what we need for our planning meeting.\n09:18 Kito: Confirmed. I’ll prepare the editable design file and a clickable link. The fee is EUR 480 as agreed.\n09:25 Nalia: Great. I’ll send any notes on the first version together so the revision round stays manageable.\n09:31 Kito: That works. I’m aiming to share the final package on 18 September 2025.\n09:36 Nalia: Please send it by email when ready. The brief’s screen list is final."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller’s invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nIssued: 15 September 2025\nSeller: Kito Nemu, independent designer, Kenya\nBuyer: Nalia Vero\nProject: LumaNest mobile app\n\nLine item: Mobile app UI design and clickable five-screen prototype — EUR 480\nIncluded: Editable design file and one round of minor visual revisions\nSubtotal: EUR 480\nTotal due: EUR 480\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe service covers the five screens described in the buyer’s brief. Development, app-store submission, and additional revision rounds are outside this fee. Planned delivery date: 18 September 2025. Please refer to the project name when asking about this invoice."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: EUR 480",
      "value": "EUR 480"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: clickable five-screen mobile app UI prototype",
      "value": "clickable five-screen mobile app UI prototype"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 18 September 2025",
      "value": "18 September 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Nalia Vero",
      "value": "Nalia Vero"
    },
